,"text":"On the back straight he passed Nuvolari's Auto Union, and leaving the North turn, Lang led with Seaman second and Nuvolari third.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":1,"text":"Oil from Brauchitsch's Mercedes blinds Nuvolari, who skids tail first into the ditch near Br\u00fcnnchen.","q":false,"c":16},{"lap":1,"text":"Biondetti had driven into a ditch on the first lap and was helped by others to regain the road and was thus disqualified.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap, Comotti crawled to the pits with the engine of his Delahaye sounding like a lawn mower.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":18},{"lap":2,"text":"After the second lap, Lang led by a bare three seconds from Seaman, then came Brauchitsch and Caracciola.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":2,"text":"Nuvolari parks his damaged Auto Union after two laps.","q":false,"c":16},{"lap":3,"text":"After three laps Brauchitsch had taken the lead by one second from Seaman with Caracciola five seconds behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":3,"text":"Lang pits to replace an oiled plug; out after 31 seconds, now seventh.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":3,"text":"Farina and Taruffi retire their Alfa Romeos, both with radiator trouble.","q":false},{"lap":4,"text":"At the end of the fourth lap Brauchitsch led after 41m50s by 5 seconds from Seaman in 41m55s and Caracciola third in 42m03s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":4,"text":"Graffenried retires with transmission damage; Berg's Maserati is out with a fuel pump defect.","q":false},{"lap":7,"text":"Brauchitsch pits: fuel and both rear wheels in 44 seconds; Seaman and Caracciola go past.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":8,"text":"Seaman stops for rear tyres and fuel (52s), Caracciola likewise (50s); Brauchitsch goes back into the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"Lang stops for wheels, fuel and plugs and hands over to B\u00e4umer; 1m49s.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":10,"text":"Caracciola hands his car to Lang, who rejoins third after 19 seconds.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":11,"text":"M\u00fcller stops and Nuvolari takes over his Auto Union, off in 38 seconds; Stuck stops for 1m05s.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":12,"text":"After twelve laps Brauchitsch after 2h05m14s led by 20 seconds from Seaman after 2h05m34s and Caracciola/Lang after 2h06m41s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":14,"text":"Hyde crashes his Maserati just after the North Turn; the car ends on its side in a ditch.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":16,"text":"After 16 laps Brauchitsch led in 2h46m16s, 13 seconds from Seaman in 2h46m29s and Caracciola/Lang in 2h50m08s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":16,"text":"Brauchitsch's overfilled Mercedes catches fire at his stop; Seaman gets away and takes the lead.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":17,"text":"Brauchitsch climbs back in after the fire, but on the same lap ends in a deep ditch past the Flugplatz.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":17,"text":"After 17 laps Seaman was leading, Lang in Caracciola's car was second, 2m13s behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":17,"text":"Hasse's Auto Union, third, stops with engine failure on the long straight; Nuvolari moves up to third. B\u00e4umer's engine also gives out.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":18,"text":"Brauchitsch walks back to the pits, detachable steering wheel in hand, to cheers.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":20,"text":"Seaman was in the lead with an advantage of 2m52s to Lang in Caracciola's car, then Nuvolari in third place, ahead of Stuck and Pietsch in fifth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":21,"text":"Seaman stops for fuel and rear tyres; Nuvolari pits for water and plugs, letting Stuck into third. Dreyfus passes the refuelling Pietsch.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":22,"text":"Seaman crossed the line victorious.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":22,"text":"Lang finishes second in Caracciola's car, ahead of Stuck and Nuvolari in M\u00fcller's Auto Union; Dreyfus fifth, a lap down.","q":false}]}